00:12:47,439 --> 00:12:48,860
Tip me over.

177
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,640
Pull me out.

178
00:12:53,300 --> 00:13:01,699
This has to be the truth, folks, because there is no way anyone could make this up.

179
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:02,700
Tip me over and pull me out.

180
00:13:02,700 --> 00:13:03,200
Tip me over and pull me out.

